# 📱 Mobile Redesign Plan — Ultra-Detailed, Section-by-Section

> **Goal:** Transform the mobile experience from a "desktop-forced-into-a-phone" into a **premium, native-feeling app** that pops with the same Black × Electric Blue × White palette as desktop — without touching the desktop layout at all.

> **Strategy:** All changes will be scoped inside `@media (max-width: 800px)` in [mobile-design.css](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/core/css/mobile-design.css) (or gated by a `.is-mobile` class). **Zero** edits to desktop rules.

